{"completed": true, "response": "{\"better\":\"Y\",\"regress\":\"有：Y把部分因果和自我辩论压缩了，像S06、S11里“为什么会转念、为什么暂不回去”的过程不如X交代得完整。\",\"nets\":{\"scan\":\"Y\",\"point\":\"Y\",\"why\":\"X\",\"whole\":\"Y\",\"fine\":\"Y\"},\"why\":\"Y更像能在听音乐时真正扫进去的屏幕：短句先钉住剧情节点，放大的关键词抓要点，感受又按音乐时机出现，因此细微变化不会一次堆满眼前，前后的反复也较容易认出来。X的因果解释更完整，尤其能看清人物怎样跟自己争辩，但不少段落左右两边同时信息过密，短停留段里容易只读到故事或只扫到感受，二者来不及合起来。\"}", "metadata": {"session_handle": "efc60dfd-ea21-48da-a9dc-1190129c1ddc", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T060152312914Z", "elapsed_seconds": 9.719, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T06:02:02.036890+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "34cbff7124759e1267857c33991d578fa592d359e733edd156535beedbd65008", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidenc